(373, 'Do you think attacking Mona Lisa portrait was the right thing?', 'An attack on the Mona Lisa painting has taken being ‘ambushed with a cake’ to the next level.\r\n\r\nVideo footage shared online shows the protective glass covering the world’s most famous artwork, by Leonardo da Vinci, smeared with icing from a cake.', 45, 1, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2022-05-31 16:24:07', '2022-06-01 11:12:43', 0, 45, 45, 1654014247, 1654081963),
