(511, 'Do you think that Trump’s Border Wall should be finished or it will never fix the problems?', '    <h2>Arguments in favor of completing the border wall:</h2>\r\n    <ol>\r\n        <li><strong>National Security:</strong> Supporters argue that a completed border wall would enhance national security by reducing illegal immigration and preventing the entry of individuals who may pose a threat to the country.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Control of Illegal Immigration:</strong> Proponents believe that a physical barrier would act as a deterrent and make it more difficult for people to cross the border illegally, thus helping to control immigration.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Economic Impact:</strong> Some argue that controlling illegal immigration could have positive economic impacts, such as protecting jobs for legal residents and reducing the strain on social services.</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n\r\n    <h2>Arguments against completing the border wall:</h2>\r\n    <ol>\r\n        <li><strong>Cost and Resources:</strong> Critics point to the high cost of constructing the wall and argue that these resources could be better allocated to address other pressing issues, such as healthcare, education, or infrastructure.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Environmental Concerns:</strong> The construction of a physical barrier may have environmental consequences, disrupting ecosystems and wildlife habitats, which raises concerns among environmentalists.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Effectiveness:</strong> Some argue that a border wall may not be the most effective solution to address the complex issues related to immigration, and that alternative measures such as technology, increased border patrol, and comprehensive immigration reform would be more practical.</li>\r\n        <li><strong>Humanitarian Concerns:</strong> Critics also raise humanitarian concerns, emphasizing the potential impact on families and individuals seeking refuge or a better life.</li>\r\n    </ol>\r\n\r\n    <p>Public opinion on this issue is diverse and often influenced by political ideologies. Ultimately, the decision on whether to finish the border wall involves weighing these various factors and considering the broader context of immigration policy and border security. So please vote and give us your opinion on this poll \"<strong>Do you think that Trump’s Border Wall should be finished or it will never fix the problem?</strong>\"</p>\r\n    ', 1186, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2023-09-29 20:25:45', '2024-05-19 21:16:54', 0, 1186, 1186, 1696019145, NULL),
(512, 'Do you support more aid to Ukraine?', '<div itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Question\">\r\n    <h2 itemprop=\"name\">Do you support more aid to Ukraine?</h2>\r\n    <div itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\r\n        <div itemprop=\"text\">\r\n            According to our sociological research for theme \"Do you support more aid to Ukraine?\" there is 73% voted \"Yes\", and 27% voted \"No\". The survey was conducted all over the world. Data as of July 25, 2023.\r\n            <br>\r\n            <p>You can also vote in this poll via the link <a href=\"https://en.referendum.social/poll/512\"> Click here </a>.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>', 1186, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2023-10-02 19:14:19', '2024-05-19 21:16:54', 0, 1186, 1186, 1696274059, NULL),
