(516, 'Do you think that Elon Musk is a Russian agent?', '<div itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"mainEntity\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Question\">\r\n    <h2>Elon Musk is a Russian agent?</h2><p>Elon Musk become more and more \"right-wing\" views. It\'s his choice and I personally respect his decision, as anyone else\'s. But he become a more and more pro-Russian guy, who wants to end the war in Ukraine in a good-for-Russia way. So that\'s why I ask people in this poll \"Do you think that Elon Musk is a Russian agent?\" Please take part in this public opinion and write some comments with your thoughts.&nbsp;</p><h2 itemprop=\"name\">Do you think that Elon Musk is a Russian agent?</h2>\r\n    <div itemscope=\"\" itemprop=\"acceptedAnswer\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/Answer\">\r\n        <div itemprop=\"text\">\r\n            According to our sociological research for the theme \"Do you think that Elon Musk is a Russian agent?\" there is 81% voted \"Yes\", and 18% voted \"No\". The survey was conducted all over the world. The number of people, who participated in this poll is 380. Data of update as of February 23, 2024.<br>\r\n            <p>You can also vote in this poll via the link <a href=\"https://en.referendum.social/poll/516\"> Click here </a>.</p>\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n</div>', 1186, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2023-10-06 18:07:55', '2024-05-19 21:16:54', 0, 1186, 1186, 1696615675, NULL),
