(560, 'What do you think about yoga?', 'Guys, there will still be an open yoga class near me in Toronto, so I&#039;m thinking about going to try it. But before that, I want to ask: what do you think about yoga? Share your thoughts and join the discussion below.', 45, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2024-10-28 21:03:46', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1730149426, 1730149426),
(561, 'What is a better household cleaner castile soap or murphy&#039;s?', 'So, I’ve been using castile soap cleaner for some time to clean my house, and I would say that I didn’t have any complaints about it. But my friend, when he was in my house, noticed that I’m using it and strongly suggested Murphy’s cleaner soap.\r\n\r\nHe said that it is simply better than castile soap, but I have my doubts. So, what would you say? What is a better household cleaner castile soap or Murphy&#039;s??\r\n\r\nGive your answers below or in the comments. Thank you.', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2024-12-06 12:36:53', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1733488613, 1733488613),
(562, 'Is Multiculturalism Working?', 'So i saw this poll on BBC &quot;Is Multiculturalism Working?&quot;. Same survey was in the UK, Europe on channel &quot;Good morning Britain&quot; and there was very high stake to is &quot;no&quot; option. But i want to see it myself and because of that creating this public opinion/poll. I think same question was asked in Canada, Europe, Australia', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2024-12-25 18:50:54', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1735152654, 1735152654),
(563, 'Which is better: Hankook Optimo H426 or Kinergy 4S2?', 'Im plaining to change tires in my truck. And hear both good feedbacks about Hankook Optimo H426 and Kinergy 4S2. But which from them is better? And why? Help me please choose - which is better: Hankook Optimo H426 or Kinergy 4S2?', 45, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-06 10:30:58', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1738837858, 1738837858),
(564, 'Which insurance is better Tower hill or Olympus?', 'I move to Florida and see that there is two major insurance company - Tower hill and Olympus. But which of them is better? Can you help me choose?', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-10 11:38:39', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1739187519, 1739187519),
(565, 'which tractor is cheaper Kubota or Kioti?', ' am planning to buy a new tractor for my farm and can’t decide which one to buy: Kubota or Kioti. Can you guys help me out? I understand that the price of the tractor is not the only expense, but maintaining it is as well. So, can you please tell me which tractor is cheaper: Kubota or Kioti? I will look around at all the answers.', 45, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-17 11:16:27', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1739790987, 1739790987),
(566, 'Spørsmål', '<p>Sp&oslash;rsm&aring;l</p>', 1174, 0, 0, 0, 1, 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-18 09:34:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1, 1174, 1, 1739871289, 1739871438),
(567, 'Which one is better Aviclear or Acutane for acne?', 'Im having terrible acne... And hearing about these both things: Aviclear and Acutane, About both these product ive heard bad and good things. Can you help me to choose wich one will be better and for what exactly? I just cant choose now. Any answer will help me', 45, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-02-24 15:00:13', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1740409213, 1740409213),
(568, 'CMR: Which gold scheme is best?', 'I am looking for the way to invest in gold and looking for advice - Which gold scheme is best? in CMR. I heard, that actually you can invest in silver now. Because of their use in batteries for electric cars and etc. What would you say?', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-27 12:06:40', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1743077200, 1743077200),
(569, 'Gold versus porcelain which is more sensitive?', 'I just had this thought in bed before sleep — gold versus porcelain: which is more sensitive? I understand that, in general, porcelain is more sensitive. But I would say otherwise — it’s more fragile. Gold is also sensitive and gentle, but not fragile. If you hit a gold it will leave a mark on gold. But if you hit porcelain  it canfall apart completely.', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-03-31 18:12:41', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1743444761, 1743444761),
(570, 'Nylon or polyester straps: Which is better?', 'Im planing to buy my first gear to do hiking. But i want to buy once and to last it for long time. Can you advice me Nylon or polyester straps: Which is better?', 45, 0, 0, 0, 3, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-04-08 08:22:01', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1744100521, 1744100521),
(571, 'Which is better: 3m 5200 or Jb Marine Weld for boats?', 'Im planning to fix my leakage in my old boat (it around 20 years old). Which will be better for it?  Which is better: 3m 5200 or Jb Marine Weld for boats?', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-04-29 16:20:57', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1745943657, 1745943657),
(572, 'Which is better Frostburg Maryland or Wilkes-Barre to live at in 2025?', '<p>I somehow escaped Ukraine and war in there and moved to USA. Now im thinking what place from these two Frostburg Maryland and Wilkes-Barre for me and my family to live in 2025. <br />Any ideas? Im labour worker, wife can work on the restaraunt kitchen.&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-07-29 15:56:01', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1753804561, 1753804748),
(573, 'Which is better - the three or four step for bowling?', '<p>Helly guys. Im kinda new in bowling, but really fun to mee and i feel that it is my thing. What would you say will be best for me - which is better - the three or four step for bowling? Im just want to setup my skill in the right way from the begining. Also, maybe it will be important - im lefthanded. Thanks to all the feedbacks!</p>', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-06 18:02:44', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1754503364, 1754504247),
(574, 'Which is better tube-tech hlt2-a or hlt2-a mastering?', 'Im working on setup of my Studio and moved to analoge equalizere. And there is question for me - Which is better tube-tech hlt2-a or hlt2-a mastering? Can you guys help me out?', 45, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-09 21:59:56', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1754776796, 1754776796),
(575, 'Which certification is higher or safer Usp or Iso?', '<p>Im thinking to change my drugs prescription, there is two the same drugs, one is 20% cheaper. But that one is that cheaper has ISO certification, but other has USP. SO which certification is higher or safer Usp or Iso? OR which certification is more stringent or safer usp or iso?</p>', 45, 0, 0, 0, 2, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-12 17:56:59', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1755021419, 1755367561),
(576, 'How much money is in your savings account?', 'Hi. I just looking thought internet and wanted to know how much money do you have in your saving account? I wanted to compare my savings with yours. Mine is around 10 000 usd+. What about you? ', 45, 0, 0, 0, 1, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '2025-08-16 19:41:15', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 45, 45, 1755373275, 1755373275);
