(233, NULL, 551, 1171, 'Look at the results… Mr Lube has so many complaints honestly! That survey is just to recover their reputation online…\r\n', 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2024-01-15 12:03:34', '2024-05-19 21:16:57', 1171, 1171, 1705320214, NULL),
(234, 233, 551, 1171, 'That company sucks. They have nice buildings but their workers don’t have the imagination to solve simple mechanical issues', 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, '2024-01-15 12:04:01', '2024-05-19 21:16:57', 1171, 1171, 1705320241, NULL),
(238, NULL, 563, 1174, 'Kinergy 4S2 is better—stronger grip in wet and light snow, plus all-weather performance. Optimo H426 is a basic touring tire, good for comfort but not great in bad weather. If you need year-round reliability, go Kinergy. If mild climate and comfort matter', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-02-10 12:15:42', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1, 1739189742, 1739190187),
(239, NULL, 564, 1174, 'Olympus has better customer service and claims handling. Tower Hill is more financially stable. If you want smoother claims, go Olympus. If stability matters more, Tower Hill is a safer bet. Check policy details to match your needs.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-02-17 10:23:03', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1739787783, 1739787783),
(243, NULL, 565, 45, 'Kubota is usually more expensive upfront but holds value better and has wider dealer support, making maintenance easier. Kioti is cheaper and offers good features but might have pricier parts and fewer service locations. If long-term reliability matters, Kubota is the safer bet. But its for you to decide', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-02-24 14:41:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 45, 45, 1740408109, 1740408109),
(244, NULL, 567, 1174, 'Acutane is stronger for severe acne but has more side effects and requires medical supervision. Aviclear is a newer laser treatment with fewer risks but works best for mild to moderate acne. If you need aggressive results, go Acutane. For a gentler option, try Aviclear.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-03-27 09:49:56', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1743068996, 1743068996),
(245, NULL, 568, 1174, 'If you’re looking for a CMR gold scheme, go for one with low fees, flexible payment options, and good buyback rates. Compare interest rates and storage costs before deciding. If you plan long-term investment, choose a scheme with higher purity and resale value.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-03-31 17:44:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1743443045, 1743443045),
(246, NULL, 569, 1174, 'Porcelain is more sensitive to pressure and can chip or crack easier than gold. Gold is more durable and adapts better to temperature changes, making it less likely to cause sensitivity. So if sensitivity&#039;s a concern, gold is usually the better pick.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-04-08 08:22:55', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1744100575, 1744100575),
(247, NULL, 570, 1174, 'Nylon straps are comfier, more breathable, and dry quicker—great for everyday use. Polyester straps are stronger, more UV and water-resistant, and keep their color longer. If you want comfort, go nylon. For toughness and outdoor wear, polyester is better.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-04-29 16:14:30', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1745943270, 1745943270),
(248, NULL, 571, 1174, '3M 5200 is better for permanent, waterproof bonding—it’s crazy strong but hard to remove later. JB Marine Weld is easier to use and good for quick repairs, but not as flexible or long-lasting. If it’s a critical, long-term seal, go with 3M 5200.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-07-29 15:49:50', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1753804190, 1753804190),
(249, NULL, 572, 1174, 'Frostburg’s quieter and feels more tight-knit, great if you like small-town vibes. Wilkes-Barre’s bigger, cheaper housing, more stuff to do, but also rougher in spots. If you want peace, go Frostburg. For convenience and lower costs, Wilkes-Barre.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-08-06 17:45:32', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1754502332, 1754502332),
(250, NULL, 573, 1174, '3-step is simpler and good for beginners or if you want consistency without overthinking. 4-step gives more momentum and power, popular with experienced bowlers. If you’re new, start with 3. If you want extra speed and hook, go 4.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-08-09 20:37:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1754771822, 1754771822),
(251, NULL, 574, 1174, 'Tube-Tech HLT-2A provides the definitive all-tube shelving EQ with the charming “tilt” T-filter - best for smooth, musical shaping with warmth and character.\r\nHLT-2A Mastering (HLT2AM) coins in with stepped pots and narrower range of control—perfect when working on precision and recall in mastering applications—though at rather a premium cost hike.\r\nNeed smooth, rapid tonal shaping? HLT-2A is your style. Want pinpoint resolution and recall capability for mastering? Spring for the Mastering version.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-08-12 17:42:07', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1755020527, 1755020527),
(252, NULL, 257, 45, 'I genuinle belive that alternative medicine works and it very often helps with sickness, but the only thing is it cannot be the only way of treatment. I mean you always first need to listen to the doctor and maybe even right away during the talk with doctor ask what I can use from alternative medicine, but I mean something adequate, not like drinking urine or something else. I mean like, for example, to say that I have there some elderberry compote, let’s say, or maybe it is worth to try drinking it during, or to eat some concrete fruits. For example vitamin C is often recommended, or D3, and to ask the doctor if it’s possible instead of those vitamins to just eat oranges, and instead of D3 somehow to eat baked fish. I think this is alternative medicine which actually will be more effective.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-08-16 20:02:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 45, 45, 1755374555, 1755374555),
(253, NULL, 575, 1174, 'I think that, honestly, you don’t need to worry about which certification is higher or safer. USP or ISO. Because, as I see it, this questioning is for America, for the USA. So here, it doesn&#039;t really matter to check which one is safer in this case. If you’re asking about medicine, about tablets or something like that. Because from what I can tell, I’m not living in America right now. I live in other countries. Actually, in a third-world country. And when I was in America, I saw that everything on the shelves is top class. I mean, the best quality products, probably the best in the world, are all sold in America. Including in medicine. So I think you don’t need to worry about which certification is higher or safer.', 1, 1, 1, 0, 0, '2025-08-16 20:07:48', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 1174, 1174, 1755374868, 1755374868);
